{"id":"vod_bf_5175","vodId":"5175","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"出包王女 Darkness","name_cn":"出包王女 Darkness","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-6/a097091b01cb6edafa478241694cba86.jpg"},"summary":"结城梨斗（渡边明乃 配音）是一位平凡的高中生，暗恋着青梅竹马西连寺春菜（矢作纱友里 配音），然而，腼腆的梨斗决心将这份真挚地感情深深埋藏在心底，每日只是在角落里偷偷地凝望着自己的女神。　　某日，一位名叫菈菈·萨塔琳·戴比路克（户松遥 配音）的外星女王突然从天而降，成为了梨斗的同居人，就这样，梨斗开始了和菈菈一起的没羞没臊地生活。金色暗影（福圆美里 配音）本是为了暗杀梨斗而来的宇宙第一杀手，却莫名其妙地留在了地球，为了让金色暗影重新返回杀手界，黑咲芽亚（井口裕香 配音）被派出来到了梨斗的身边，这一次，又会有怎样有趣的故事发生呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 23:32:36","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/chubaowangnvDarkness/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:42:53.059Z"}